OL,3,AFrench ex-President Sarkozy and wife
OL,4,ACarla Bruni to face trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicolas Sarkozy and his wife Carla
OL,7,FBruni-Sarkozy are to face trial next
OL,8,Fyear over charges stemming from the
OL,9,Fformer French president's conviction
OL,10,Ffor conspiring to fund his election
OL,11,Fcampaign with money from late Libyan
OL,12,Fdictator Muammar Gaddafi.
OL,14,FThe charges centre on the retraction of
OL,15,Fthe testimony of a key witness who had
OL,16,Finitially said he had evidence that
OL,17,Fcould incriminate Sarkozy.
OL,19,FThe pair deny any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
