OL,3,AIndian government has 'lost the plot',
OL,4,Asays 'cockroach' leader barred from UK
OL,5,Aflight
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the leaders of India's
OL,8,F"cockroach" movement has said the Delhi
OL,9,Fgovernment has "completely lost the
OL,10,Fplot" after he was stopped from leaving
OL,11,Fthe country for the UK.
OL,13,FSaurav Das said he was meant to board a
OL,14,Fflight on Tuesday morning but was told
OL,15,Fby immigration officers his passport
OL,16,Fhad been "flagged" because of
OL,17,Fdiscrepancies involving his date of
OL,18,Fbirth.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795564092
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIndian government has 'lost the plot',
OL,4,Asays 'cockroach' leader barred from UK
OL,5,Aflight
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn an interview with the BBC, Das said
OL,8,Fthere were no discrepancies in his
OL,9,Fdocuments, accusing the Indian
OL,10,Fgovernment of using cheap tactics to
OL,11,Fstop activists from travelling and
OL,12,Fspeaking on issues that matter to young
OL,13,Fpeople.
OL,15,FThe BBC has reached out to the federal
OL,16,Fhome ministry, Delhi police and airport
OL,17,Fofficials for comment.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
