OL,3,AHuawei found guilty of stealing trade
OL,4,Asecrets but acquitted of racketeering
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Huawei said the
OL,7,Fracketeering acquittal "confirms that
OL,8,Fthese allegations lack factual basis
OL,9,Fand vindicates our consistent position
OL,10,Fover the past eight years".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
